-----------------------------------------------------------------

Where:  gnx_py/models/tides.py, the step-2 solid-tide correction:
        step2_diurnal, step2_long_period, solid_tide_step2,
        _fundamental_arguments_deg and the tables _STEP2DIU / _STEP2LON.
What:   a derived work of the IERS Conventions (2010) routines STEP2DIU and
        STEP2LON (called by DEHANTTIDEINEL; V. Dehant, original code 1996;
